  "body_text": "最近一直在云南游学出差\n工厂每周都会寄一些样本给我做远程测试\n最近测下来特别喜欢的几只豆子\n埃塞俄比亚\n埃塞 Rumudamo 水洗\n埃塞 Shantawene 水洗 越来越细腻了\n埃塞 Delo 日晒 细腻 细腻 细腻\n埃塞 Sentayahu 日晒\n墨西哥\n墨西哥 CoE4 恰帕斯 圣路易斯瑰夏农场 Gesha 日晒  很甜、有轻微的厌氧发酵感，像果干\n哥伦比亚\n哥伦 贝图里亚 条纹波旁  水洗 柑橘、莓果、甜\n哥伦 Aponte小农 卡杜拉 蜜处理， 柑橘，中低温会有一些日晒的果味出来\n哥伦 Tolima 圣路易斯 Bourbon Sidra 水洗，相比条纹波旁莓果特征会更凸显一些，但也同时具备柑橘特征\n云南\n蔓飞龙 厌氧水洗，也是值得试试的\n佐园 瑰夏 ，强推！！！也是越来越好喝，新批次的日晒、以及刚上的水洗",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content autoTypeSetting24psection\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          最近一直在云南游学出差\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          工厂每周都会寄一些样本给我做远程测试\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          最近测下来特别喜欢的几只豆子\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 16px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n            埃塞俄比亚\n           </span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n            埃塞 Rumudamo 水洗\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n            埃塞 Shantawene 水洗 越来越细腻了\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-size: 14px;\">\n            埃塞 Delo 日晒 细腻 细腻 细腻\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            埃塞 Sentayahu 日晒\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 16px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n            墨西哥\n           </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n            墨西哥 CoE4 恰帕斯 圣路易斯瑰夏农场 Gesha 日晒  很甜、有轻微的厌氧发酵感，像果干\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 16px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n            哥伦比亚\n           </span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);list-style-type: circle;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<li style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style